异，根据宝宝生长发育选择分阶段米粉，为宝宝提供更精准科学的营养。</p>\n\n        <div class=\"stage stage1\">\n          <div class=\"stage-badge\">\n            <div class=\"circle\">\n              <span class=\"seg\">1段</span>\n              <span class=\"en\">Sitting</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stage-content\">\n            <div class=\"stage-title\">第一阶段 宝宝羞涩期</div>\n            <p>宝宝可以辅食量逐渐增加——这时可添加1段米粉。</p>\n            <p>1段米粉含铁高，粉质细腻好吸收。</p>\n            <p>适应后可添加蔬菜泥和水果泥。</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"stage stage2\">\n          <div class=\"stage-badge\">\n            <div class=\"circle\">\n              <span class=\"seg\">2段</span>\n              <span class=\"en\">Crawling</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stage-content\">\n            <div class=\"stage-title\">第二阶段 宝宝爬行期</div>\n            <p>宝宝萌牙期——这时可添加2段米粉。</p>\n            <p>2段米粉在1段基础上会添加一些蔬菜颗粒，用以启智喂养外伴着宝宝对促智的吸收。</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"stage stage3\">\n          <div class=\"stage-badge\">\n            <div class=\"circle\">\n              <span class=\"seg\">3段</span>\n              <span class=\"en\">Standing</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"stage-content\">\n            <div class=\"stage-title\">第三阶段 宝宝能站立</div>\n            <p>宝宝会爬行——这时可添加3段米粉。</p>\n            <p>3段米粉相比2段米粉添加了多种更大的果蔬颗粒，以此强化锻炼宝宝咀嚼力；并与多种食材搭配，口感丰富，更能激发宝宝的味蕾，让宝宝爱上吃。</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Card 2 -->\n    <div class=\"card card2\">\n      <div class=\"card-header\">\n        <span class=\"num-badge\">2</span>\n        宝宝吃米粉的好处\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n          <div class=\"benefit-num\">1</div>\n          <div class=\"benefit-text\">\n            <div class=\"btitle\">补充乳类中不足的营养\n              <span class=\"nutrient-icons\">\n                <span>Fe</span><span>Va</span><span>Vd</span>\n              </span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"bdesc\">添加米粉等辅食，可及时补充母乳中铁和维生素D的不足。</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n          <div class=\"benefit-num\">2</div>\n          <div class=\"benefit-text\">\n            <div class=\"btitle\">训练宝宝的吞咽能力</div>\n            <div class=\"bdesc\">宝宝可以从糊状、细软的食品开始，逐步适应，接受成年人吃的固体食物。</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n          <div class=\"benefit-num\">3</div>\n          <div class=\"benefit-text\">\n            <div class=\"btitle\">为断奶做准备</div>\n            <div class=\"bdesc\">辅食逐渐取代乳类，让宝宝逐渐由吸食乳类变为用成年人的方式咀嚼食物。</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n          <div class=\"benefit-num\">4</div>\n          <div class=\"benefit-text\">\n            <div class=\"btitle\">开启宝宝智力</div>\n            <div class=\"bdesc\">添加辅食可以给予宝宝多种刺激，进而达到启迪智力的目的。</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"benefit-item\">\n          <div class=\"benefit-num\">5</div>\n          <div class=\"benefit-text\">\n            <div class=\"btitle\">训练咀嚼能力</div>\n            <div class=\"bdesc\">及时添加辅食有利于训练宝宝的咀嚼功能，有利于颌骨的发育和牙齿的萌出。</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Card 3 -->\n    <div class=\"card card3\">\n      <div class=\"card-header\">\n        <span class=\"num-badge\">3</span>\n        如何挑选宝宝米粉\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card-body\">\n        <div class=\"select-item\">\n          <div class=\"select-num\">1.</div>\n          <div class=\"select-text\">\n            <span class=\"stitle\">选择品牌产品</span><br>\n            建议选择大品牌、口碑好的产品，其质量相对而言更有保障。\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"select-item\">\n          <div class=\"select-num\">2.</div>\n          <div class=\"select-text\">\n            <span class=\"stitle\">查看产品标识</span><br>\n            看一看正品商品应有的标识是否齐全，宝宝产品特有的标志以及说明书印在包装上。\n            <di